                        <p>This is the most direct consequence of understanding "imagined orders." The things that define your identity\u2014your nationality, your belief in human rights, your religion, your concept of money, your career ambitions\u2014are not objective truths. They are powerful fictions, stories created and passed down through generations.</p>
